# GROUP PROJECT WORK (PICK ONE)
## Design a web or mobile app that can track the location of people or objects in real-time. A
group can select any of following capabilities for your implementation:
- Track the location of a laptop computer based on its IP address. Research how IP
locations are determined and discuss the potential accuracy/limitations.
- Track the movement of a person carrying a mobile phone through GPS or cell tower
triangulation. Discuss the pros and cons of each approach.
